#: ../../zh/release_note.md:23
msgid "Triton-Ascend 3.2.0"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend 3.2.0"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:25
msgid "**首次发布：Ascend NPU 支持**"
msgstr "**First release: Ascend NPU is supported.**"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:27
msgid ""
"Triton-Ascend 3.2.0 是第一个正式支持华为 Ascend NPU 的 Triton 版本。此版本基于 Triton 3.2.0 "
"社区版本，专门适配 Ascend NPU 硬件架构。"
msgstr ""
"Triton-Ascend 3.2.0 is the first Triton version that officially supports"
"Huawei Ascend NPU. This version is based on the Triton 3.2.0 community"
"version and is specially adapted to the Ascend NPU hardware"
"architecture."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:29
msgid "主要特性"
msgstr "Main Features"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:31
msgid "**Ascend NPU 全栈支持**"
msgstr "1\. **Full-stack support for Ascend NPU**"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:32
msgid "完整的 Triton IR 到 NPU 指令集编译流水线"
msgstr ""
"   - The instruction set compilation pipeline from Triton IR to NPU is"
"complete."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:33
msgid "支持全部 Triton Ops"
msgstr "   - All Triton Ops are supported."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:35
msgid "**性能优化**"
msgstr "2\. **Performance optimization**"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:36
msgid "NPU 特定内核优化"
msgstr "   - NPU-specific kernel optimization"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:37
msgid "CV 计算优化"
msgstr "   - CV compute optimization"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:39
msgid "**开发者工具**"
msgstr "3\. **Developer tools**"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:40
msgid "支持全面的调试输出"
msgstr "   - Comprehensive debug output is supported."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:41
msgid "编译中间产物转储"
msgstr "   - Intermediate compilation products are dumped."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:43
msgid "已知限制"
msgstr "Known Limitations"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:45
msgid "**数据类型**: 部分数据类型支持仍在完善中"
msgstr "1\. **Data type**: Some data types are still being improved."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:46
msgid "**算子覆盖**: 正在持续扩展支持的算子集合"
msgstr ""
"2. **Operator coverage**: The supported operator set is being"
"continuously expanded."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:48
msgid "迁移指南"
msgstr "Migration Guide"

